Name Rio Note - Chaos #2 Exterminators Copacabana

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Find a secluded, hard-to-reach spot, activate the beacon and leave as soon as possible. Make sure to keep a low profile during departure.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 Alpha will be providing you with safe haven upon arrival to São José. If questioned, claim to be tourists.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 May the ZPD fall!